HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 고지서 지참(은행 영업시간 : 09시~16시)</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 등록금 납부금액이 \"0\"(전액면제자)인 경우에는 은행 직접 방문하여</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;등록절차(등록처리)를 이행하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span><br></font></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;■ 개인별 가상계좌번호로 등록금 납부/입금(</strong>인터넷뱅킹, 폰뱅킹 등 이용시)</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 받는 사람 이름을(학생본인이름) 필히 확인하세요.</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 보내는 사람은 학생이름이 아니라도 상관없습니다.</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(보호자 통장으로 이체 가능합니다.)</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 가상계좌번호는 매학기마다 변경될 수 있습니다.</span><br></font></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;■ <strong>“학생회비”를 납부하고자 할 경우 등록금과 합산하여 입금하세요</strong>.</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 등록금액 \"0\"(전액면제자)인 경우 학생회비 납부시 등록처리 됩니다.</span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#ffffff\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #7c43b1\">&nbsp; 2. 등록금 납부제도 </font></span></strong>&nbsp;</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">■ 농협카드, 농협비씨카드로 등록금 납부</font></strong></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 연말정산시 신용카드 소득공제항목에서 제외됩니다.</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 카드사용 포인트가 적립되지 않습니다.</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 할부시 할부(이용)수수료가 발생됩니다.</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ </font><font color=\"#0900ff\">등록금 분할납부를 신청한 경우 신용카드 납부가 되지 않습니다.</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 신용카드와 고지서를 지참하여 은행을 직접 방문하여 납부 가능하며,</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;